{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_28366","headline":"春末题池州弄水亭 · 杜牧","name":"春末题池州弄水亭","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"使君四十四，两佩左铜鱼。\n爲吏非循吏，论书读底书。\n晚花红艳静，高树绿阴初。\n亭宇清无比，溪山画不如。\n嘉宾能啸咏，宫妓巧粧梳。\n逐日愁皆碎，随时醉有余。\n偃须求五鼎，陶秪爱吾庐。\n趣向人皆异，贤豪莫笑渠。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"杜牧","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_28366.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_28366","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}